{"about":["FIVE DAMNED SOULS","Buried deep within the center of the earth, trapped in the bowels of an insane computer for the past hundred and nine years. Gorrister the suicidal loner, Benny the mutilated brute, Ellen the hysterical phobic, Nimdok the secretive sadist, Ted the cynical paranoid.","ONE CHALLENGE","The adventure plunges you into the tortured and hidden past of the five humans. Delve into their darkest fears. Outwit the Master Computer AM in a game of psychological warfare. Disturbing, compelling. An adventure you won't easily forget!","• Assume the roles of five different characters, each in a unique environment","• Challenging dilemmas dealing with powerfully charged emotional issues","• Provocative psychological and adult-oriented themes","• Based on Harlan Ellison's short story \"\"I Have No Mouth, and I Must Scream\"\", one of the ten most reprinted stories in the English language","• Full digitized speech with over 40 different characters and state of the art animation","• Harlan Ellison as the voice of the insane master computer, AM.","Offline single player","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/0715/a190b52e13633d07fc4990fc5b0dea208bd49618f80e02ce.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/0715/a190b52e13633d07fc4990fc5b0dea208bd49618f80e02ce.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/0715/2ca26c063ae1a94b0dfc45d5121f91990a012b3810d8ed8d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/0715/2ca26c063ae1a94b0dfc45d5121f91990a012b3810d8ed8d.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/0715/74535e3b53d113a6ca5f43e61927cf44e06a5349400c6f3d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"